          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", no pisará jamás una casilla clara. Por eso cada bando tiene dos alfiles: uno para las casillas claras y otro para las oscuras."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Look at the marked squares: they are all dark. A "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "diagonal",
            "text": "diagonal"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " never changes colour, so this bishop, standing on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", will never step on a light square. That is why each side has two bishops: one for the light squares and one for the dark ones."
          }
        ]
      },
